          <p>I worked as a freelance full-stack engineer, then as a Technical Advocate at Discourse. I built customer solutions in Rails and Ember, ran hard migrations and took on complex projects.</p>
          <span class="accent">Subscriptions now in Discourse core · Migrated the Straight Dope (posts from 1998)</span>
