          <p>I led marketing at Discourse for a year, then spent four years at Fidelity with a community of 2,500+ family-office executives. I owned its engagement, research and governance programs, and grew from community manager into a program and strategic leader.</p>
          <span class="accent">Champions program grown from 20 to 75 · Active users from 50% to 60% · Five-year plan approved unanimously</span>
